  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building For Georgia&apos;s National Examination Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Grant will support: (a) capacity building of the core staff of the National Examination Center (NAEC), which at present is charged with all testing and assessment activities; (b) introduction of new evaluation methods in the existing teacher certification system; (c) design of a credible and comprehensivesystem for the selection and evaluation of principals of general education schools; and (d) conducting the World Bank&#x2019;s SABER benchmarking instrument on teacher policies.  TF014363</narrative>
  </description>
